  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of medical supplies in a targeted manner to facilitate the continued provision of medical care to victims of the war in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Vluchteling will provide a monthly contribution of &#x20AC; 75.000 SV to support the purchase, transport and delivery of medical supplies by Stichting Artsenhulp to hospitals in Ukraine. The selection of hospitals will be subject to ongoing dialogues between Stichting Artsenhulp and Stichting Vluchteling, and with partners on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
